 "remarks": "Beautiful 3-bedroom townhouse ideally located just minutes from Greenwich and Downtown Stamford. Situated in the West Park Townhomes, a boutique community of only nine residences, this home offers quality craftsmanship paired with the convenience of city living. The open floor plan features 9-foot ceilings, open plan kitchen, marble bathrooms and an abundance of natural light throughout. Enjoy easy access to Metro-North, restaurants, shopping, parks, and everything Downtown Stamford has to offer while being just moments from the Greenwich border.",
